01:06:53,048 --> 01:06:57,448
Lay it across your bed, hang it on your wall, take it with you on an outing—think of the possibilities!

842
01:06:59,808 --> 01:07:08,048
Secondly, whilst on thy noble journey, thou mayest come to need a spark of aid.

843
01:07:08,048 --> 01:07:17,768
If it be so, take one of these amulets: the emblem of a knight to boost your strength, the emblem of a samurai to grant you additional dexterity,

844
01:07:17,768 --> 01:07:24,808
the emblem of a priestess to bestow additional health to thy weary body, and lastly,

845
01:07:24,808 --> 01:07:30,408
the emblem of a necromancer to grant the additional intelligence.

846
01:07:30,408 --> 01:07:37,808
Alas, as fortune be a fickle mistress, thou may only receive one in a set. I pray thee be granted the boon most favorable to thy quest.

847
01:07:37,808 --> 01:07:49,568
Or... or you could just purchase them all separately if you're looking to speedrun the experience, I suppose.
Or you could just purchase them all separately if you're looking to speedrun the experience, I suppose.

848
01:07:49,568 --> 01:07:57,848
Thirdly, I present to thee the shining centerpiece of this valuable collection.

849
01:07:57,848 --> 01:08:05,008
Take a moment of repose and sit beside this warm and healing light, granted unto thee by Death herself.

850
01:08:05,008 --> 01:08:17,948
A lantern to revive thee as many times as needed throughout even the most daunting of journeys, may it light thy way to victory or to sweet dreams, whichever is preferred.

851
01:08:17,948 --> 01:08:30,448
Enjoy an elegant design chosen specifically by myself. And of course, how could one continue a journey into vast and unforgiving lands without a source of healing?

852
01:08:30,808 --> 01:08:43,008
Rejuvenate thyself with this generous flask, or rather, glass, that seems to refill endlessly upon rest at your lantern—at least, I think it will.

853
01:08:43,008 --> 01:08:57,008
There really are no guarantees in this life, but give it a try yourself, see if the myths are true. Enjoy your favorite beverage during a night of exploring your favorite fantasy scenarios.

854
01:08:57,008 --> 01:09:09,008
But naturally, it'd do me no good to leave you without the... I don't know, bedtime story?
But naturally, it'd do me no good to leave you without a... I don't know, bedtime story?

855
01:09:09,008 --> 01:09:21,008
To put this enchanting collection into context, so please enjoy a short audiobook-style recording of a fantastical story written by yours truly.

856
01:09:21,008 --> 01:09:32,008
Believe it or not, we are the stars of this tale, so enjoy it on a rainy evening wrapped warmly in Death's embrace.

857
01:09:32,008 --> 01:09:45,008
The... the blanket, I mean. You can use the flask, uh, also for like drinking at the same time. I don't know, just you should really buy the full set.

858
01:09:45,008 --> 01:09:53,008
And definitely do, because lucky skeletons who act fast and purchase the entire set will be granted a hand-signed postcard with a special color variant of Shimhaq's masterpiece rendition of Death herself.

859
01:10:01,558 --> 01:10:04,558
Happy Birthday to me!!

860
01:10:05,058 --> 01:10:08,558
6 birthdays, huh?! This time was even more special than usual.

861
01:10:09,058 --> 01:10:12,558
Much love to my guests, my Dead Beats, my band,

862
01:10:13,058 --> 01:10:16,558
and everyone who wants to see me fly!

863
01:10:17,058 --> 01:10:20,558
Let's have an even happier year... together!!

